{"quest_id": 6187, "name": "千一鬼夜行（記憶）", "description": "鬼の大将酒呑童子を加えた妖怪千鬼夜行。\n迫る悪鬼の大群を打ち倒し、\n東の国の民たちを守り抜け！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "戦場の記憶～追憶の章～", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920094, "map_no": 5222, "level": 80, "multiplier": 0.8, "charisma": 25, "exp": 200, "gold": 800, "drops": [{"card": 236, "c": 3}, {"card": 55, "c": 1}, {"item": 1001, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 1}, {"card": 1654, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 77, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 560, "attack": 120, "base_hp": 700, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100288, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 237, "global_id": 236, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 800, "base_hp": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100320, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 239, "global_id": 238, "spawn_sec": 78}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "level": 80, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2400, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 750, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2099328, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 102, "global_id": 101, "spawn_sec": 78}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "level": 80, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2400, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 750, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 400.0, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2099328, "race_id": 4, "change_to": 4, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 30440, "global_id": 4059, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 4054, "spawn_sec": 85}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "level": 80, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 5040, "attack": 256, "base_hp": 6300, "base_attack": 320, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 12, "attack_interval": 42, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2111056, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 54, "master_id": 30435, "global_id": 4054, "from_condition": 2}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 12000, "attack": 1040, "base_hp": 15000, "base_attack": 1300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 1, "attack_interval": 64, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2107200, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 30441, "global_id": 4060, "spawn_sec": 106}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "サヨ", "text": "聖霊に人間に。魔物以外には妖怪とも戦ったよね。\n中でも100体以上の妖怪に加え、鬼の大将、酒呑童子とも\n戦った激戦はほんとに凄かった……。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "――王子、私に届いていた手紙によれば、\nもうすぐこの東の国を妖怪が襲撃するハズです。", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "『妖怪猫娘よ。決起の時は来たれり。\nあまねく妖怪の力を結集し、再び千鬼夜行を巻き起こそうぞ\n次に月が満ちる夜、東の国にて待つ』", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "差出人に妖怪総大将って書いてるんですが、\n私を誰かと勘違いしているのでしょうかね？", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "あ、まだ続きがありました。", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "『追伸\n　　こたびの夜行には復活を果たした鬼の大将\n　　酒呑童子も加われり』", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "鬼の大将……王子、気を付けてくださいね。\nさぁ、東の国の皆さんを守りに行きましょう！", "face": "u28"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "サヨ", "text": "わたしの変装術に加えてあの妖怪の数。\nわたしが居た事に気づかなくても仕方ないわね。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "組んず解れつの妖怪千鬼夜行。\n変装が解けちゃうんじゃないかって\nちょっとヒヤヒヤしてたわ。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "そして、この戦いの後も、妖怪軍団拡大を図る\nぬらりひょんとは何度か戦う事になるのよね……。", "face": "u510"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920094_5222", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 186, "y": 105}, {"k": "b", "x": 827, "y": 108}, {"k": "m", "x": 413, "y": 195, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 257, "y": 416, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 750, "y": 301, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 763, "y": 170, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 668, "y": 251, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 506, "y": 141, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 340, "y": 466, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 510, "y": 354, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 686, "y": 466, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 338, "y": 250, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 241, "y": 172, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 171, "y": 356, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 260, "y": 301, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 423, "y": 300, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 599, "y": 410, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 591, "y": 301, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 585, "y": 194, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 425, "y": 411, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 837, "y": 360, "id": 218}, {"k": "m", "x": 767, "y": 409, "id": 219}, {"k": "r", "x": 308, "y": 355, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 373, "y": 355, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 642, "y": 353, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 705, "y": 356, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 495, "y": 221, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 508, "y": 265, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 513, "y": 437, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 515, "y": 486, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 830, "y": 462, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 183, "y": 460, "id": 309}]}, "start_cost": 35, "active": true}